{
  "sourceLanguage" : "en",
  "strings" : {
    "Logs and Cache" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "日志与缓存"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Export recent logs" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "导出最近日志"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Exports the latest 5 runs and text logs, up to 20 MB before compression. Video is omitted. Stop watching or running a task before exporting." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "导出最近 5 次执行和文字日志，压缩前最多 20 MB，不含录影。请先停止守候和当前任务。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Diagnostic storage" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "诊断数据占用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Saved runs" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已保存的执行记录"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clear logs and diagnostic cache" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "清除日志与诊断缓存"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Automatic cleanup" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "自动清理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keeps up to 20 runs for 7 days within 80 MB. Each run keeps at most 8 MB / 120 recent video frames and 12 MB of step images. Old export files expire after 1 day. Clearing keeps model settings, board pairing, calibration, knowledge and learned cases. Stop watching or running a task to clear." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "执行记录最多保留 20 次、7 天、共 80 MB；每次最多保留 8 MB／120 张最近录影帧，以及 12 MB 步骤截图。导出临时文件保留 1 天。清理保留模型设置、设备配对、校准、知识与学习记录。请先停止守候和任务再清理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clear logs and diagnostic cache?" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "清除日志与诊断缓存？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Deletes saved diagnostic runs, screenshots, video frames and old export files. Your setup and knowledge are kept." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "删除已保存的诊断执行记录、截图、录影帧和旧导出文件，保留设置与知识。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Logs and diagnostic cache cleared." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "日志与诊断缓存已清除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Run diagnostics are cleaned automatically. Manage saved logs, recent video frames and export files in Logs and Cache." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "执行诊断会自动清理。请在“日志与缓存”管理日志、最近录影帧和导出文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I can't see the iPhone screen clearly. Check Screen Mirroring; if it keeps happening, stop it in Control Center and select Lan Agent again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "看不清 iPhone 画面。请检查屏幕镜像；如果一直这样，请在控制中心停止镜像，再重新选择 Lan Agent。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It said it was done three times without doing it in this run. Look at the screen, then go on or stop." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它三次说已完成，但这次其实还没做。请看一下画面，再决定继续还是停止。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Went wrong %lld times in a row." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "连续出错 %lld 次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reached the step limit." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已到步数上限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the board was not back on its Wi-Fi within 5 minutes" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "5 分钟内开发板没有重新连上 Wi-Fi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Board Wi-Fi…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "等待 Wi-Fi…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The board is reconnecting to Wi-Fi…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开发板正在重新连接 Wi-Fi…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check Wi-Fi" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "检查 Wi-Fi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check the Wi-Fi to continue" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请检查 Wi-Fi 后继续"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The board lost its Wi-Fi. Waiting for it to reconnect…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开发板断开了 Wi-Fi，正在等它重新连上…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The board is still off its Wi-Fi. Make sure the Wi-Fi is on and in range, and keep this iPhone on the same Wi-Fi; the run goes on when the board is back." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开发板还没连上 Wi-Fi。请确认 Wi-Fi 开着、离开发板不远，并让 iPhone 连着同一个 Wi-Fi；开发板连上后任务会继续。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The board lost its Wi-Fi" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开发板断开了 Wi-Fi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checking the mirrored screen…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在确认镜像画面…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checking the mirrored screen took too long. Wait a few seconds and start again; if it keeps happening, stop mirroring in Control Center and select Lan Agent again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "确认镜像画面超时。请等几秒再开始；如果一直这样，请在控制中心停止镜像，再重新选择 Lan Agent。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not done yet" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "还没完成"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The board is disconnected. Reconnect it before starting." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开发板已断开，请重新连接后再开始。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Screen Mirroring is not streaming. Connect to Lan Agent in Control Center, wait for the preview, then start again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "屏幕镜像尚未开始传输。请在控制中心连接 Lan Agent，等预览出现后再开始。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Screen Mirroring is connected, but no decodable screen is available. In Control Center, stop mirroring and select Lan Agent again. Wait for the preview, then start again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "屏幕镜像已连接，但当前画面无法解码。请在控制中心停止镜像，再重新选择 Lan Agent，等预览出现后再开始。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The run is still active. Return to the Home Screen to continue." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "任务仍在进行中。请返回手机主屏幕以继续。"
