            "value" : "打开一个已填好版本信息的 GitHub issue。请附上「日志 › 导出全部日志」生成的压缩包：里面有调试日志、运行记录，以及 iOS 交给本 App 的崩溃报告。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A zip of debug.log, crash reports from iOS and every run (steps, model replies, screenshots, video). Your API key is never in it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "包含 debug.log、iOS 崩溃报告和每次运行（步骤、模型回复、截图、视频）的压缩包。不会包含你的 API 密钥。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Asks Lan Agent to do a task on this phone, like \"Open Settings and go to Wi-Fi\"." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
