            "value" : "清除学到的内容"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stored on this iPhone only: up to 128 tap positions (256 KB) and up to 200 lessons in words (400 KB): your notes, accepted AI hints and the app's own review of each run, each kept with the task it came from, so words from a task stay too. Lessons for similar tasks are sent to the model with the request. No screenshots are kept. Live screens are always checked before acting." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只保存在这台 iPhone 上：最多 128 个点按位置（256 KB），以及最多 200 条文字经验（400 KB），包括你的备注、接受的 AI 优化提示和 App 对每次任务的自动复盘。每条经验会连同它来自的任务一起保存，所以任务里的文字也会留下。遇到类似任务时，相关经验会随请求发给模型。不保存截图。每次操作前都会先确认实时画面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stayed instead of going back" : {
